## Scripts

`scripts/{{ENTRY_SCRIPT}}` — CLI entry point

```
python scripts/{{ENTRY_SCRIPT}} --input <task_list.json> --output <task_list.json>
```

Arguments:

| Name | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `--input` | yes | upstream task_list JSON path |
| `--output` | yes | output task_list JSON path |

Runtime dependencies (C-extension packages that cannot be vendored) are declared
in the entry script's `MSA_REQUIRES` list; `main()` calls `ensure_deps(...)` before
processing. A hard-missing dependency prints `MSA_ENV_MISSING: <mod> -- pip install
"<spec>"` and exits 4; a soft dependency degrades instead of gating. Set
`MSA_AUTO_INSTALL=1` to let the skill `pip install` the missing package itself.

