## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| exit 4 with "MSA_ENV_MISSING" | a C-extension dependency in `MSA_REQUIRES` is not importable | run the printed `pip install` command, or set `MSA_AUTO_INSTALL=1` |
| exit 2 with "msa_contract_version mismatch" | msa_shared was bumped, this skill was not synced | update the skill frontmatter and the `MSA_CONTRACT_VERSION` constant |
| all tasks skipped | every upstream stage failed | fix upstream first |
| ImportError: msa_shared | vendored scripts/msa_shared/ missing or bootstrap block altered | run tools/vendor_msa_shared.py sync; copy the self-locating block from msa-skill-spec/SKILL.md §4.1 |
